---
This repository contains NOTHING that comes from MAME. MAME's core (`scsp.cpp`, `scspdsp.cpp`,
`scsp_mame.cpp`), under BSD-3-Clause with its own rights holders, stays in `fv2-recomp`: the licence
boundary runs exactly at this repository's edge, and that is why it is kept apart.

The Yamaha SCSP (YMF292) is a Yamaha chip, and Virtua Fighter 3 and Fighting Vipers 2 alike belong to
SEGA. Neither is here: this repository holds only code written for this project, and the measurements
that guided it.
